  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initial Assessment Study for Decarbonization of Fertilizer Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to support the decarbonization of the fertilizer sector. Within the scope of the proposed activities, the initiative seeks to address the strategic initial steps of the sector&#x2019;s transformation process within a structured technical framework.The overall focuses of the project are assessment of the current situation in the fertilizer sector, identifying opportunities for low-carbon transformation, capacity development and preliminary impact assessment of the ETS-CBAM</narrative>
  </description>
